# Testing

- Every behaviour change needs tests. Do not weaken tests to obtain a pass.
- Engine rules get unit tests. Schemas get contract tests. Persistence and sockets get integration tests.
- Keep classic renderer fixtures as a regression baseline.
- Combat and rewards must have deterministic, idempotent cases.
- Do not use `any` to silence a failing type.
